  "notes": [
    "Entries are added before implementation and are never renumbered (docs/technical/91 \u00a7 Verification registry).",
    "The structural validator for this file is owned by TASK-FND-009-002. Until it lands, the shape here matches tests/verification/FND-001.json exactly.",
    "Selectors are repository scripts and wrapper invocations rather than NUnit selectors on purpose. doc 100 \u00a7 Repository structure prescribes exactly four test projects and none of them owns the workflow wrapper, so the wrapper's own gates are shell fixtures. TASK-FND-009-002 may move the registered-verb-set assertion into the registry validator.",
    "Exit classes asserted here are doc 100 \u00a7 Standard command surface classes: 0 success, 2 invalid verb/arguments, 3 missing or mismatched pinned environment, 4 validation/test failure, 5 build/import/export/package failure, 8 unexpected tool-internal failure. There is no class 1.",
